    "notes": "Wikidata Q1333411 and OSM way 374945234 identify the memorial. The mapped centerline of The Mall sets the signed axis and the exterior view shows Queen Victoria facing the Mall. Sculpture anatomy, carved details and minor fountain fittings are medium-fi interpretations of the exterior photographs. Water in the pools is represented by static surfaces. The outline, basin polygons, statue points and The Mall supply the main layout. Steps and elevations follow standard terrain and visual proportions. Physical-device timings are unmeasured."
  },
